# t0816-restart-after-a-refusal -- A device restarted by a client this listener has been refusing
# The sequence this pack is about. Each line is one security event:
#   <listener kind> <action> <reason>
# fire: the whole sequence, which must report.
# hold: the same sequence one signal short, which must not.
fire
  iec104 deny rule
  iec104 deny rule
  iec104 deny rule
  iec104 engineering engineering_restart
hold
  iec104 deny rule
  iec104 deny rule
  iec104 deny rule
